Arafat & Muzdalifah", "desc": "15 May - 09 Zil Hajj - A/C marquee in Arafat; night in Muzdalifah"}, {"day": "DAY 10", "title": "Mina (Eid / Rami)", "desc": "16 May - 10 Zil Hajj - Maktab A, Zone 1 near Jamarat"}, {"day": "DAY 11", "title": "Mina", "desc": "17 May - 11 Zil Hajj - Maktab A, Zone 1 near Jamarat"}, {"day": "DAY 12", "title": "Return to Makkah", "desc": "18 May - 12 Zil Hajj - A: Intercontinental - B: Fairmont Clock Tower"}, {"day": "DAY 13", "title": "Departure", "desc": "19 May - 13 Zil Hajj - Departure to airport"}]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Meet & assist at the airport (Jeddah / Madinah Hajj Terminal)', 'Group airport transfers to hotel (by Naqaba / Saudi Moallim)', 'Makkah hotel accommodation, half-board (breakfast & dinner)', 'Madinah hotel accommodation, half-board (breakfast & dinner)', 'Full-board buffet meals in Mina (8-12 Zil Hajj)', 'Maktab A-Category tent in Mina, Zone 1 near Jamarat (avg 16/tent, sofa-cum-bed, private toilet)', 'Air-conditioned marquee in Arafat with meals & hot/cold drinks', 'Floor mat & snack box in Muzdalifah', 'Private luxury buses (2025 model) with bathroom for Mashaer days (Mina-Arafat-Muzdalifah)', 'Makkah - Madinah transfer by high-speed train', 'Ziyarat in Madinah with guidance', 'Hajj training & guidance in Pakistan / Saudi Arabia', 'Religious guide book', 'Assistance with Qurbani & Tawaf-e-Ziyara', 'Mic & speaker for religious guidance'], ARRAY['Airline ticket (approx PKR 335,000 from Karachi / PKR 345,000 from North Pakistan)', 'Qurbani (approx SAR 720 per person)', 'Personal expenses & anything not listed under inclusions', 'Optional supplements & upgrades (Deluxe / Diamond tent, Kaaba view, extra Madinah nights, family rooms)'], '{}', 'active', true);

